### 👋 About me

I'm a **Senior Data Engineer** with 5+ years building and running production data platforms — the kind where billions of rows, strict SLAs and enterprise banking clients are the default, not the edge case.

- 🏦 One of **two engineers** operating a **Customer Data Platform** serving **72M customers** and **200M+ daily transactions** at **HCLSoftware**
- 🧩 Built a **warehouse-agnostic dbt framework** — one codebase running on **Oracle, SQL Server, Snowflake, Databricks, PostgreSQL and MariaDB**; onboarding a new client warehouse is a config change, not a port
- 🏛️ Led the **Canonical Data Model**: a **Data Vault 2.0** raw layer feeding **star-schema marts** with **SCD Type 2** for Customer 360, campaign & journey analytics
- ⚡ Redesigned analytical serving for billion-row datasets — **ClickHouse + Druid (−60% dashboard latency)** and an **Apache Iceberg** lakehouse migration (**−50% query time**)
- 🤖 Ship **ML data pipelines** (features, training, batch inference) and explore **LLM agents** for text-to-Cypher and automated pipeline RCA
- 🧭 Own production reliability (monitoring, alerting, on-call) and mentor engineers on data modeling, dbt and pipeline design

---

