### 🚀 Featured projects

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

#### 🚚 [FleetStream — Real-Time Fleet Intelligence](https://github.com/pradyumna001/FleetStream-Real-Time-Fleet-Intelligence-Platform)
Streaming lakehouse for IoT vehicle telemetry: **Kafka → Spark Structured Streaming → Iceberg → dbt → Trino**. Injects real failures (duplicates, late & invalid events) and `make verify` **proves** each one was caught — dedup, quarantine, row conservation, reconciliation.

`Kafka` `Spark` `Iceberg` `dbt` `Trino` `MinIO` `Terraform`

</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

#### 🧩 [Database-Agnostic dbt Framework](https://github.com/pradyumna001/db_agnostic_dbt_project)
One dbt project, many warehouses. **Dispatch macros** isolate engine-specific SQL, types and functions so the same models run on any supported warehouse — switching engines is a profile change, not a rewrite.

`dbt` `Jinja` `adapter.dispatch` `SQL` `Airflow`

</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

#### 🏗️ [Data Pipeline with CI/CD & Terraform](https://github.com/pradyumna001/automated_data_pipeline_cicd_terraform)
Medallion pipeline (**Bronze → Silver → Gold**) with PySpark ETL, Airflow DAGs, Terraform-provisioned infra and GitHub Actions CI/CD — fully containerized.

`PySpark` `Airflow` `Terraform` `GitHub Actions` `Docker`

</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

#### 🕸️ Customer 360 Graph + Text-to-Cypher Agent *(PoC)*
Customer 360 graph model in **Neo4j** with an **LLM agent** that turns natural-language audience requests into Cypher from the graph schema. Plus a **DataHub** lineage pilot and an Airflow + lineage **root-cause analysis** hackathon build.

`Neo4j` `LLM Agents` `DataHub` `Airflow`

</td>
</tr>
</table>

